#: src/php/Settings/General.php:924
msgid "Site config is valid. Save your changes."
msgstr "有效的網站組態。請儲存設定。"

#. translators: 1: privacy link, 2: terms link.
#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:132
msgid "For more information about hCaptcha’s privacy policy and terms of use, please visit the following links: %1$s and %2$s."
msgstr "如需進一步了解 hCaptcha 的隱私權及使用條款的相關資訊，請造訪所列連結: %1$s 及 %2$s。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:127
msgid "IMI acts as a \"data processor\" acting on behalf of its customers as defined under the GDPR, and a \"service provider\" for the purposes of the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)."
msgstr "依據 GDPR 的定義，IMI 是代表其客戶處理資料的資料處理單位；依據《加州消費者隱私法》(California Consumer Privacy Act，簡稱 CCPA)，IMI 則是服務提供單位。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:124
msgid "and other forms of abuse that can harm our service or other users of our service."
msgstr "這些濫用行為可能會損害我們的服務或使用我們服務的使用者。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:121
msgid "In addition, processing may also be based on Art. 6(1)(f) of the GDPR: our online service has a legitimate interest in protecting the service from abusive automated crawling, spam,"
msgstr "除此之外，也會依照 GDPR 的 6(1)(f) 條處理: 我們的線上服務擁有免受濫用惡意檢索、垃圾訊息侵擾的合法權益，"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:118
msgid "and that activities performed by the user are not related to fraud or abuse."
msgstr "且使用者執行的活動與詐騙或濫用無關。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:115
msgid "Our online service (including our website, mobile apps, and any other apps or other forms of access offered by us) needs to ensure that it is interacting with a human, not a bot,"
msgstr "我們的線上服務 (包含這個網站、行動裝置 App，及我們提供的其他 App 或任何方式的存取) 需要確保是與真人互動，而非漫遊器，"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:112
msgid "or in order to take steps at the request of the website visitor prior to entering into a contract."
msgstr "或為了在簽訂合約之前根據網站訪客的要求採取措施有其必要。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:109
msgid "Data processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) of the GDPR: the processing of personal data is necessary for the performance of a contract to which the website visitor is party (for example, the website terms)"
msgstr "資料的處理遵循 GDPR 的 6(1)(b) 條: 處理個人資料對於作為一方當事人的網站訪客履約 (例如網站條款)"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:106
msgid "Website or app visitors are not advised that such an analysis is taking place if the user is not shown a challenge."
msgstr "如果不為訪客顯示人機驗證，便無法告知網站或行動裝置 App 訪客正在進行這類分析。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:103
msgid "hCaptcha analysis in the \"invisible mode\" may take place completely in the background."
msgstr "使用 hCaptcha 的隱形模式，便會完全在背景中進行分析。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:100
msgid "The data collected during the analysis will be forwarded to IMI."
msgstr "分析過程中所收集的資料會傳送至 IMI。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:97
msgid "For the analysis, hCaptcha evaluates various information (e.g. IP address, how long the visitor has been on the website or app, or mouse movements made by the user)."
msgstr "hCaptcha 會評估各種資訊以進行分析，例如 IP 位址、訪客在網站或行動裝置 App 中的停留時間，或由使用者操作的滑鼠移動。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:94
msgid "This analysis starts automatically as soon as the website or mobile app visitor enters a part of the website or app with hCaptcha enabled."
msgstr "只要網站或行動裝置 App 訪客進入啟用了 hCaptcha 的網站或行動裝置 App 區域，這項分析便會自動開始。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:91
msgid "To do this, hCaptcha analyzes the behavior of the website or mobile app visitor based on various characteristics."
msgstr "為了執行這些檢查，hCaptcha 會依據各種特性分析網站或行動裝置 App 訪客的行為。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:88
msgid "hCaptcha is used to check whether user actions on our online service (such as submitting a login or contact form) meet our security requirements."
msgstr "hCaptcha 用於檢查使用者在使用我們的線上服務 (例如送出登入要求或傳送聯絡表單) 時，是否符合我們的安全性要求。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:85
msgid "This service is provided by Intuition Machines, Inc., a Delaware US Corporation (\"IMI\")."
msgstr "這項服務由美國德拉瓦州公司 Intuition Machines, Inc. (簡稱 IMI) 提供。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:82
msgid "We use the hCaptcha security service (hereinafter \"hCaptcha\") on our website."
msgstr "這個網站使用 hCaptcha 安全服務 (以下稱為 hCaptcha)。"

#: src/php/Admin/Privacy.php:77
msgid "We use the hCaptcha service to protect forms on our website from spam and automated bots. hCaptcha provides a verification mechanism to distinguish between human users and bots."
msgstr "這個網站使用提供辨別真人使用者及惡意漫遊器驗證機制的 hCaptcha 服務，藉以保護網站上的表單免於垃圾訊息及自動化惡意漫遊器侵擾。"

